  ✖ P-R9 host: CREATION_STORAGE_MISSING, CORRUPT_STATE and CONTENT_CONFLICT (a copied file) are permanent typed memos, no reopen, no tombstone inferred; a REMOVE closes only the storage-missing slot (0.992615ms)
