  ✖ P-R13 host: two hosts restart over the shared journal; each inventory holds only its own node's creation (0.45379ms)
  ✖ P-R14 host: a REMOVE racing the restart re-entry takes custody: the re-entry is not started, the creation link survives, one REMOVE_COMPLETED (0.383663ms)
  ✖ P-R15 process custody: no second composition runs the inventory while the owner lock is held; a failed startup cleanup keeps the lock (ledger path, labelled) (0.459003ms)
